{"slug":"/components/contact-section","title":"Contact Section — Animated React Component — Planes","desc":"A contact form written as a letter to a real person.","html":"<main class=\"min-w-0 py-24\"><section><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1.5 px-4 pb-2 sm:px-8 lg:px-16\"><h1 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] sm:text-3xl\">Contact Section</h1><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full bg-foreground/8 px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-semibold text-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock size-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"11\" x=\"3\" y=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg> Pro</span></div><div class=\"py-10 sm:py-14\"><div class=\"relative flex items-center justify-center bg-background min-h-[60vh] py-12 sm:py-16\"><div class=\"w-full\"><section class=\"w-full\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-24\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"relative size-11 shrink-0\"><span class=\"block size-full overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-zinc-100 ring-1 ring-black/5 dark:bg-zinc-900 dark:ring-white/10\"><img src=\"/images/team/maya-chen.webp\" alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\" class=\"size-full object-cover select-none\"/></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute right-0 bottom-0 size-3 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 ring-2 ring-white dark:bg-emerald-400 dark:ring-zinc-950\"></span></span><div class=\"min-w-0\"><p class=\"text-[14px] font-medium text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100\">Write to <!-- -->Maya</p><p class=\"text-[13px] text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\">Usually replies within a day</p></div></div><div class=\"relative mt-10\"><form noValidate=\"\" aria-busy=\"false\"><p class=\"text-[clamp(1.5rem,3.2vw,2.5rem)] leading-[1.65] font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] text-zinc-400 dark:text-zinc-500\">Hi <!-- -->Maya<!-- -->, I&#x27;m <span class=\"relative inline-grid max-w-full align-baseline leading-[1.15]\"><label for=\"_R_kqnpfksnksdb_-name\" class=\"sr-only\">Your name</label><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"invisible col-start-1 row-start-1 whitespace-pre\">your name</span><input id=\"_R_kqnpfksnksdb_-name\" type=\"text\" aria-invalid=\"false\" autoComplete=\"name\" placeholder=\"your name\" size=\"1\" class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1 w-full min-w-0 border-b-[1.5px] bg-transparent text-zinc-900 outline-none transition-colors duration-150 placeholder:text-zinc-400 dark:text-zinc-100 dark:placeholder:text-zinc-500 border-zinc-300 focus:border-zinc-900 dark:border-zinc-700 dark:focus:border-zinc-100\" value=\"\"/></span> from<!-- --> <span class=\"relative inline-grid max-w-full align-baseline leading-[1.15]\"><label for=\"_R_kqnpfksnksdb_-company\" class=\"sr-only\">Company, optional</label><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"invisible col-start-1 row-start-1 whitespace-pre\">your company</span><input id=\"_R_kqnpfksnksdb_-company\" type=\"text\" aria-invalid=\"false\" autoComplete=\"organization\" placeholder=\"your company\" size=\"1\" class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1 w-full min-w-0 border-b-[1.5px] bg-transparent text-zinc-900 outline-none transition-colors duration-150 placeholder:text-zinc-400 dark:text-zinc-100 dark:placeholder:text-zinc-500 border-zinc-300 focus:border-zinc-900 dark:border-zinc-700 dark:focus:border-zinc-100\" value=\"\"/></span>. I&#x27;d like to talk about<!-- --> <button id=\"_R_kqnpfksnksdb_-topic\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Topic: sales. Press to change.\" class=\"relative inline-grid cursor-pointer overflow-hidden border-b-[1.5px] border-zinc-300 align-baseline leading-[1.15] text-zinc-900 outline-none transition-colors duration-150 hover:border-zinc-500 focus-visible:border-zinc-900 dark:border-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-100 dark:hover:border-zinc-500 dark:focus-visible:border-zinc-100\"><span class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1 whitespace-pre\" style=\"opacity:1;transform:none\">sales</span></button>. Here&#x27;s the gist: <span class=\"relative inline-grid max-w-full align-baseline leading-[1.15]\"><label for=\"_R_kqnpfksnksdb_-message\" class=\"sr-only\">Message</label><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"invisible col-start-1 row-start-1 whitespace-pre\">what you are working on</span><input id=\"_R_kqnpfksnksdb_-message\" type=\"text\" aria-invalid=\"false\" placeholder=\"what you are working on\" size=\"1\" class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1 w-full min-w-0 border-b-[1.5px] bg-transparent text-zinc-900 outline-none transition-colors duration-150 placeholder:text-zinc-400 dark:text-zinc-100 dark:placeholder:text-zinc-500 border-zinc-300 focus:border-zinc-900 dark:border-zinc-700 dark:focus:border-zinc-100\" value=\"\"/></span>. You can reach me at<!-- --> <span class=\"relative inline-grid max-w-full align-baseline leading-[1.15]\"><label for=\"_R_kqnpfksnksdb_-email\" class=\"sr-only\">Email</label><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"invisible col-start-1 row-start-1 whitespace-pre\">you@company.com</span><input id=\"_R_kqnpfksnksdb_-email\" type=\"email\" aria-invalid=\"false\" autoComplete=\"email\" inputMode=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@company.com\" size=\"1\" class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1 w-full min-w-0 border-b-[1.5px] bg-transparent text-zinc-900 outline-none transition-colors duration-150 placeholder:text-zinc-400 dark:text-zinc-100 dark:placeholder:text-zinc-500 border-zinc-300 focus:border-zinc-900 dark:border-zinc-700 dark:focus:border-zinc-100\" value=\"\"/></span>.</p><div class=\"mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-4\"><button type=\"submit\" aria-busy=\"false\" class=\"group relative inline-flex h-12 items-center rounded-full px-6 bg-zinc-900 text-[15px] font-medium text-white shadow-[inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.3)] outline-none transition-[background-color,opacity] duration-300 hover:bg-zinc-700 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-zinc-900/30 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-white disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:hover:bg-zinc-900 dark:bg-zinc-100 dark:text-zinc-900 dark:shadow-none dark:hover:bg-zinc-300 dark:focus-visible:ring-white/30 dark:focus-visible:ring-offset-zinc-950 dark:disabled:hover:bg-zinc-100 opacity-50\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2\" style=\"opacity:1;filter:blur(0px)\">Send to <!-- -->Maya<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4 transition-transform duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.23,1,0.32,1)] group-hover:-rotate-45 motion-reduce:transition-none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center\" style=\"opacity:1\"><span class=\"size-3.5 rounded-full border-[1.5px] border-white/30 border-t-white dark:border-zinc-900/30 dark:border-t-zinc-900 animate-[spin_0.7s_linear_infinite]\"></span></span></button><p class=\"text-[13px] text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\">We only use your email to reply.</p></div></form><span class=\"sr-only\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div></div></section></div></div></div><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl space-y-16 px-4 py-16 sm:px-8 lg:px-16\"><section id=\"installation\" class=\"scroll-mt-24\"><h2 class=\"mb-5 text-lg font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em]\">Installation</h2><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\" style=\"opacity:1;transform:none\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full bg-foreground/8 px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock size-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"11\" x=\"3\" y=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg> Pro</span><span class=\"text-[12px] text-muted-foreground\">Requires a Planes Pro license.</span></div><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-black/5 dark:border-white/5 bg-neutral-50/80 dark:bg-neutral-900/95 backdrop-blur-xl backdrop-saturate-150 p-4 shadow-xs\"><div class=\"absolute right-3 top-3 z-10\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-lg bg-secondary p-1\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy\" class=\"relative inline-flex size-7 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-surface-overlay text-foreground shadow-sm transition-colors duration-150 will-change-transform hover:bg-surface-overlay/80 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"shrink-0 size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\" opacity=\"1\" style=\"transform:none;transform-origin:50% 50%;transform-box:fill-box\"></path><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" opacity=\"1\" style=\"transform:none;transform-origin:50% 50%;transform-box:fill-box\"></rect><path d=\"M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5\" class=\"text-emerald-500 dark:text-emerald-400\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" opacity=\"0\" pathLength=\"1\" stroke-dashoffset=\"0\" stroke-dasharray=\"0 1\"></path></svg></button></span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto pr-20 font-mono text-[12.5px] leading-6 text-foreground/90 [scrollbar-width:none] [&amp;::-webkit-scrollbar]:hidden\">npx shadcn add @useplanes/contact-section</pre></div><p class=\"-mt-1 text-[12px] leading-5 text-muted-foreground\">Works once the<!-- --> <a class=\"text-foreground underline-offset-4 hover:underline\" href=\"/setup\">@useplanes registry</a> <!-- -->is set up in your project (one-time). After that, copy and run commands directly.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-xl border border-black/5 dark:border-white/5 bg-neutral-50/80 dark:bg-neutral-900/95 backdrop-blur-xl backdrop-saturate-150 p-5 shadow-xs sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-lg bg-secondary p-1\"><span class=\"flex size-7 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-surface-overlay text-foreground shadow-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-key-round size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2.586 17.414A2 2 0 0 0 2 18.828V21a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h3a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h1a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h.172a2 2 0 0 0 1.414-.586l.814-.814a6.5 6.5 0 1 0-4-4z\"></path><circle cx=\"16.5\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle></svg></span></span><div><p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-foreground\">Unlock with Planes Pro</p><p class=\"text-[13px] leading-5 text-muted-foreground\">$99 once · 160 Pro components · lifetime updates.</p></div></div><div class=\"inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1 self-start rounded-lg bg-secondary p-1 sm:self-auto\"><a class=\"inline-flex h-9 items-center rounded-md bg-surface-overlay px-3 text-[13px] font-medium text-foreground/60 shadow-sm transition-[color,transform] duration-150 hover:text-foreground active:scale-[0.97] focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring\" href=\"/setup\">I have a license</a><a class=\"group inline-flex h-9 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md bg-surface-overlay px-4 text-[13px] font-semibold text-foreground shadow-sm transition-[color,transform] duration-150 hover:text-foreground/80 active:scale-[0.97] focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring\" href=\"/#pricing\">Get Pro<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></section><section id=\"usage\" class=\"scroll-mt-24\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-5\"><div role=\"tablist\" class=\"inline-flex w-fit items-center gap-1 rounded-lg bg-neutral-200/60 dark:bg-white/5 p-1\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"_R_5anpfksnksdb_-tab-usage\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-controls=\"_R_5anpfksnksdb_-panel-usage\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"relative inline-flex h-9 items-center rounded-md px-4 text-[13px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring text-foreground\"><span class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-md bg-white shadow-sm dark:bg-neutral-800\"></span><span class=\"relative z-10\">Usage</span></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"_R_5anpfksnksdb_-tab-props\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"_R_5anpfksnksdb_-panel-props\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"relative inline-flex h-9 items-center rounded-md px-4 text-[13px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring text-foreground/55 hover:text-foreground\"><span class=\"relative z-10\">Props</span></button></div><div role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"_R_5anpfksnksdb_-panel-usage\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_5anpfksnksdb_-tab-usage\" style=\"opacity:1;transform:none\"><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"absolute right-3 top-3 z-10\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-lg bg-secondary p-1\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy\" class=\"relative inline-flex size-7 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-surface-overlay text-foreground shadow-sm transition-colors duration-150 will-change-transform hover:bg-surface-overlay/80 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"shrink-0 size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\" opacity=\"1\" style=\"transform:none;transform-origin:50% 50%;transform-box:fill-box\"></path><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" opacity=\"1\" style=\"transform:none;transform-origin:50% 50%;transform-box:fill-box\"></rect><path d=\"M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5\" class=\"text-emerald-500 dark:text-emerald-400\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" opacity=\"0\" pathLength=\"1\" stroke-dashoffset=\"0\" stroke-dasharray=\"0 1\"></path></svg></button></span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-black/5 dark:border-white/5 bg-neutral-50/80 dark:bg-neutral-900/95 backdrop-blur-xl backdrop-saturate-150 px-5 py-4 pr-16 shadow-xs text-[13px] leading-6\" data-language=\"tsx\"><code class=\"font-mono text-foreground/90\">import { ContactSection } from &quot;@/components/ui/ContactSection&quot;;\n\n&lt;ContactSection\n  recipient={{ name: &quot;Maya&quot;, photo: &quot;/team/maya.webp&quot;, replies: &quot;Usually replies within a day&quot; }}\n  topics={[&quot;sales&quot;, &quot;support&quot;, &quot;a partnership&quot;]}\n  onSubmit={async (values) =&gt; {\n    await fetch(&quot;/api/contact&quot;, { method: &quot;POST&quot;, body: JSON.stringify(values) })\n  }}\n/&gt;</code></pre></div></div></div></section><section id=\"use-cases\" class=\"scroll-mt-24\"><h2 class=\"mb-5 text-lg font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em]\">Use cases</h2><ul class=\"grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2\"><li class=\"rounded-lg border border-black/5 dark:border-white/5 bg-neutral-50/80 dark:bg-neutral-900/95 backdrop-blur-xl backdrop-saturate-150 p-4 shadow-xs\"><p class=\"text-sm font-medium tracking-tight\">Founder-led startups</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[13px] leading-5 text-muted-foreground\">A contact page that reads like writing to a real person, not filing a ticket.</p></li><li class=\"rounded-lg border border-black/5 dark:border-white/5 bg-neutral-50/80 dark:bg-neutral-900/95 backdrop-blur-xl backdrop-saturate-150 p-4 shadow-xs\"><p class=\"text-sm font-medium tracking-tight\">Studios and agencies</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[13px] leading-5 text-muted-foreground\">A short brief in one sentence: who you are, what it is about, how to reach you.</p></li><li class=\"rounded-lg border border-black/5 dark:border-white/5 bg-neutral-50/80 dark:bg-neutral-900/95 backdrop-blur-xl backdrop-saturate-150 p-4 shadow-xs\"><p class=\"text-sm font-medium tracking-tight\">Sales and partnerships</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[13px] leading-5 text-muted-foreground\">Swap the topics and the recipient for whoever owns the inbox.</p></li></ul></section></div><section id=\"related\" class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl scroll-mt-24 px-4 pb-16 sm:px-8 lg:px-16\" aria-labelledby=\"related-heading\"><div class=\"mb-5 flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4\"><h2 id=\"related-heading\" class=\"text-lg font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em]\">Related components</h2><a class=\"text-[13px] text-muted-foreground underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-foreground\" href=\"/components/sections\">All Sections components</a></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><a class=\"group relative flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-secondary/50 p-1 transition-colors hover:border-border hover:bg-secondary\" href=\"/components/shader-nav\"><div class=\"aspect-video w-full overflow-hidden rounded-xl 